{"act":2.0,"scenes":[{"bg_sound":"sonChap2","bg_sound2":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"lines":[{"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":1000.0,"text":"Alors que Vespera et Farrow arrivaient à Morne-Gueule, une vision d'horreur se dévoilait devant eux...","speaker1_x":1073.0,"speaker1_y":591.0,"speaker1_w":329.0,"speaker1_h":523.0,"speaker2_x":1440.0,"speaker2_y":594.0,"speaker2_w":420.0,"speaker2_h":640.0},{"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":1000.0,"text":"Les palissades de bois étaient noirci par les flammes. Les batiments voyaient leur toiture s'effondrer sous la chaleur. Des Eveillés blessés gisaient sur le sol boueux tentant de rattacher leur membres découpés.","speaker1_x":1073.0,"speaker1_y":591.0,"speaker1_w":329.0,"speaker1_h":523.0,"speaker2_x":1440.0,"speaker2_y":594.0,"speaker2_w":420.0,"speaker2_h":640.0},{"speaker3_x":960.0,"speaker3_y":594.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"SlideDroite","portrait2_effect":"SlideDroite","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Farrow : Par les ombres... Ils sont revenus pendant mon absence. L'ordre du Sang pur, ils n'ont pas seulement frapper, ils ont fait une rafle !","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Fondu","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":3.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"eveille_blesse","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":3.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"eveille_blesse","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Eveillé : Farrow... Ils ont emmené la moitié du village. Ils ont dit qu'ils allaient les \"purifier\" au domaine des cendres à l'ouest. Et pour ceux qui sont restés, la corruption des nécromanciens se propage dans leur plaies...","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"eveille_blesse","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Farrow : Vespera, je dois rester ici pour organiser la défense et les soins. On peut arreter la corruption grâce à une poudre de Vieille-aube. Mais on ne la trouve que dans les moulins au nord. Ils appartenaient à la famille Vieille-aube avant que les nécromancien y ouvre une faille...","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"eveille_blesse","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":true,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Farrow : Va d'abord au domaine des cendres. Si nous n'agissons pas vite, il ne restera que des cendres de mon village. Tu iras ensuite vers les moulins pour nous ramener la poudre. Tu es notre seul espoir Vespera, je compte sur toi !","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"SlideDroiteInverse","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"farrow_colere","portrait2_name":"vespera","portrait3_name":"eveille_blesse","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Sans un mot, Vespera s'élança vers l'ouest en direction du Domaine des cendres.","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0}],"duel_bot_id":0.0,"id":"scene_1","bg":"sBrillFeu","duel_player_deck":-4.0},{"bg_sound":"sonChap2","bg_sound2":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"lines":[{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":3.0,"portrait1_name":"","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"A l'approche des fermes, l'odeur du souffre et de la chair brulée sature l'air.","speaker1_x":824.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Fondu","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera : Le domaine est lourdement fortifié.... Je vois les flammes qui s'élève d'ici ! Je dois me depecher !","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera : Farrow m'a prévenu, ils ont parmi eux des chevalier en armure et des prêtre du soleil. Leur magie peut calciner ma peau avec leur lumière...","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera : Je vais devoir frapper vite et fort. Ils sont nombreux, voyons voir si mes failles peuvent vomir assez de monstres pour dévorer leur fanatisme.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera s'avança vers  l'entrée de la forteresse. Calme et concentré. Les gardes la fixait, surpris par son audace. Tous s'attendaient à qu'elle demande grâce. Mais un silence pesant, rompu par les crépitements du bûcher se ressentait.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost_energie","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera leva les yeux vers le ciel crépusculaire, ses pupilles s'imprenant d'une lueur violacée intense.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost_energie","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera : Ô energie dimensionel ! Prêtez moi votre force ! Donnez moi la puissace necessaire pour abatre mon ennemi !","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":651.0,"obj1_y":569.0,"obj1_w":482.0,"obj1_h":576.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Soudain, tout le corps de Vespera s'imprégna de l'aura violacée. Une puissance magique s'offra à elle.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Fondu","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Des sifflements qui dechiraient l'air vînt bouleverse le temps calme.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Fondu","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"sPortailTenebre","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Et soudain, une multitude de portail ténébreux apparurent tout autour de la forteresse. L'energie crépitaient autour de Vespera.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Pulse","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"sPortailTenebre","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Toute sortent de créature repondîrent à l'appel. Des rats géants, des bêtes putrides au yeux brulant et des morts se jettèrent sur les remparts, submergeant les gardes surpris par cette impressionnante démonstration de puissance.","speaker1_x":531.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":520.0,"speaker2_y":573.0,"speaker2_w":324.0,"speaker2_h":427.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Fondu","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"pretre_ordre_sang_pur","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"sPortailTenebre","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"C'est alors que l'inquisiteur apparu. La lumière émanant de son baton dissipa les portails proche de lui comme le Soleil dissipe les ombres.","speaker1_x":532.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1409.0,"speaker2_y":555.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"FonduInverse","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"pretre_ordre_sang_pur","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"sPortailTenebre","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"","speaker1_x":532.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"FonduInverse","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":2.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_boost","portrait2_name":"pretre_ordre_sang_pur","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Inquisiteur : Je suis Malvadius, inquisiteur en charge de ce domaine ! Tu penses vraiment que tes tours de magie vont t'épargner ? Tu sera purifier comme toutes ces abomination ! Après tout, tu n'es qu'une coquille vide corrompu par les ténèbres !","speaker1_x":532.0,"speaker1_y":574.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0}],"duel_bot_id":"Inquisiteur_Malvadius","id":"scene_2","bg":"sForteresseOrdreSangPur","duel_player_deck":"vespera_landes_sepulcre"},{"bg_sound":"sonChap2","bg_sound2":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"lines":[{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Fondu","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_affaibli","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Malgrès sa victoire contre l'inquisiteur, le contrecoup de la magie utiliser avait un impact. Mais heuresement, les membres de l'ordre du sang pur prenaient tous la fuite.","speaker1_x":528.0,"speaker1_y":621.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera_affaibli","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"\" L'inquisiteur Malvadius est mort ! Abandonnez le domaine ! Nous devons informer la Grande prêtresse au monastère ! \"","speaker1_x":528.0,"speaker1_y":622.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera, encore affaibli par la magie, se relevera et libera les Eveillés survivant à ce massacre.","speaker1_x":518.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Puis, après s'être assurer qu'ils prennaient la route vers Morne-gueule en sécurité, elle entama la route vers le Nord à la recherche des moulins.","speaker1_x":518.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0}],"duel_bot_id":0.0,"id":"scene_3","bg":"sForteresseOrdreSangPur","duel_player_deck":-4.0},{"bg_sound":"sonChap2","bg_sound2":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"lines":[{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Fondu","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"L'ascension vers le nord est une épreuve pour les sens de Vespera. Plus elle s'approche des moulin, plus l'air se chargé d'une odeur de givre et de décomposition. Les rare oiseaux qui survolaient encore la plaine tombaient comme des mouches, leur plumes se changeant en poussière.","speaker1_x":518.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Arrivant devant les moulins, il n'y avait que désolation. Des zombies, surement des paysans autrefois, erraient sans but. Des goules grattaient le sol gelé et des esprits flottaient comme des lambeaux de brumes entre les batiments.","speaker1_x":519.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Vespera : Je ressent l'energie d'une faille. Elle est puissante. C'est elle la source de cette désolation...","speaker1_x":519.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":922.0,"obj1_y":496.0,"obj1_w":447.0,"obj1_h":599.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":1.0,"portrait1_name":"vespera","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"","obj1_name":"","obj2_name":"","speaker1_flip":true,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Elle s'approcha de l'endroit tout provenait l'energie morbide. Mais trois silouhette s'interposa au travers du brouillard givrant.","speaker1_x":519.0,"speaker1_y":572.0,"speaker1_w":324.0,"speaker1_h":431.0,"speaker2_x":1411.0,"speaker2_y":557.0,"speaker2_w":351.0,"speaker2_h":484.0},{"speaker3_x":1477.0,"speaker3_y":653.0,"speaker3_w":306.0,"speaker3_h":389.0,"obj1_x":586.0,"obj1_y":182.0,"obj1_w":304.0,"obj1_h":294.0,"obj2_x":906.0,"obj2_y":183.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":967.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Fondu","portrait3_effect"